# infra/azure/Dockerfile only ever COPYs pyproject.toml, uv.lock, src/scrapper,
# and src/scrapper_api into the image build context -- exclude everything else by
# default. This repo also holds multi-GB local scrape output at the root
# (downloads/, downloads_santa_fe/) that must never be packed into a build
# context/upload; a plain deny-list would need updating every time something new
# and large shows up here, so this is an allow-list instead.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src
!src/scrapper
!src/scrapper/**
!src/scrapper_api
!src/scrapper_api/**
